},
{
"k": "19699",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}You know... This tortured, lonely pig eater bit's gonna get old eventually."
},
{
"k": "19700",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I wouldn't start with you."
},
{
"k": "19701",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Gonna tar and feather Crane?"
},
{
"k": "19702",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "If you're this screwed up..."
},
{
"k": "19703",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You always seem to walk away from fights."
},
{
"k": "19704",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "But what about the others?"
},
{
"k": "19705",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Holly..."
},
{
"k": "19706",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Gren..."
},
{
"k": "19707",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}Some people got hurt."
},
{
"k": "19708",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Hey, I'm asking the questions here."
},
{
"k": "19709",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You're the one breaking into Crane's apartment."
},
{
"k": "19710",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I'd have plenty of time to leave."
},
{
"k": "19711",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "But I don't want anything to do with that! I steer clear of Cranes bullshit."
},
{
"k": "19712",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}Whoa!"
},
{
"k": "19713",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "That worked out real well for you, didn't it?"
},
{
"k": "19714",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You're not off the hook."
},
{
"k": "19715",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Sit down and shut up."
},
{
"k": "19716",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Help me look."
},
{
"k": "19717",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Looking for Crane's witch."
},
{
"k": "19718",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{AngryC}Hey!"
},
{
"k": "19719",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "He's craftier than he looks."
},
{
"k": "19720",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}So don't... {HappyA}you know, {AngryA}hit me again."
},
{
"k": "19721",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Hear anything?"
},
{
"k": "19722",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ConcernedA}What the hell happened to you?"
},
{
"k": "19723",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}I got bills to pay."
},
{
"k": "19724",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}What else do you want me to say?"
},
{
"k": "19725",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Okay? Can we put this all behind us now?"
},
{
"k": "19726",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "The rest of us aren't so lucky."
},
{
"k": "19727",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}You wanna tell me what happened to your arm now?"
},
{
"k": "19728",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I mean, Jesus."
},
{
"k": "19729",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ThinkingA}Tweedle Dee and Dum showed up looking for me.[regret] {NormalA}They shot up the place."
},
{
"k": "19730",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[slightly nervous] {FearA}Okay okay okay, I know what it looks like, but before you go jumping to conclusions... {HappyA}Crane pays me to water his plants when he's gone."
},
{
"k": "19731",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}You can't do anything to me in the condition you're in."
},
{
"k": "19732",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[threatening] {AngryB}I wouldn't worry about that right now."
},
{
"k": "19733",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{HappyA}Ah, come on, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "19734",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Even if you wanted to."
},
{
"k": "19735",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[slightly nervous] Am I right?"
},
{
"k": "19736",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{FearA}Okay, {ConcernedA}okay!"
},
{
"k": "19737",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ConcernedA}It's not what you think."
},
{
"k": "19738",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[muttering] {AngryA}You are such a fucking creepy... {WorriedA}dog... {NormalA}person."
},
{
"k": "19739",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}[curious] No...."
},
{
"k": "19740",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[accusatory]Wait a minute, Just why are YOU here?"
},
{
"k": "19741",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}Should I have?"
},
{
"k": "19742",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Can't imagine you're sneaking around here for nothing."
},
{
"k": "19743",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[Impressed to himself]Crane must be in some kind of trouble."
},
{
"k": "19744",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "As it turns out, we're here for the same thing."
},
{
"k": "19745",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{AngryA}That's not something you need to know."
},
{
"k": "19746",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{AngryA}[blunt] I'm investigating."
},
{
"k": "19747",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "She'll lead me to Crane."
},
{
"k": "19748",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}[thinking] Crane's witch?[beat] Is that why he took off?"
},
{
"k": "19749",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "He's the murderer."
},
{
"k": "19750",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I've got it covered."
},
{
"k": "19751",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "He's involved in this."
},
{
"k": "19752",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}I have reason to believe Crane... {NormalB}might be the murderer."
},
{
"k": "19753",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ThinkingB}I'm taking care of it. {AngryA}That's all you need to know."
},
{
"k": "19754",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I'm not ready to convict him just yet."
},
{
"k": "19755",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}Crane's definitely involved in all of this. I just need to track him down."
},
{
"k": "19756",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Is he?"
},
{
"k": "19757",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Crane isn't a part of that."
},
{
"k": "19758",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Holly's sister and that other girl."
},
{
"k": "19759",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "And there's still those murders."
},
{
"k": "19760",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}I mean, the guy's clenched tighter than a... you know, than a... well, I'm having difficulty coming up with something appropriately tight right now, but you get what I'm--[is cut off]"
},
{
"k": "19761",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}Give me a fucking break. {NormalA}Ichabod Crane?"
},
{
"k": "19762",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[thinking] I guess he did always seem kind of off, but murder... I don't know, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "19763",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}Alright Jack, that's enough."
},
{
"k": "19764",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[sigh] {SarcasticA}Why am I not surprised?"
},
{
"k": "19765",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}How long are you gonna go on like this?"
},
{
"k": "19766",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}Your friends are fine. At least... they'll recover."
},
{
"k": "19767",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Tweedle Dee..."
},
{
"k": "19768",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Yeah? And what if they don't?"
},
{
"k": "19769",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{AngryA}Wherever you get bored and decide to \"do some good\" -- whatever the Hell that means with you -- it's always everyone else who winds up getting hurt."
},
{
"k": "19770",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "One day, the people you hurt won't get better. They just won't."
},
{
"k": "19771",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[getting angry] {AngryA}Shit, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "19772",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}[sigh] Right."
},
{
"k": "19773",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}I guess I already know anyway."
},
{
"k": "19774",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Then I'll know more."
},
{
"k": "19775",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{HappyA}[nervous; trying to joke] Wow, it is just... unbelievable running into you here. I mean, of all the places."
},
{
"k": "19776",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[accusatory] {AngryB}What {AngryA}are you doing here?"
},
{
"k": "19777",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[low panting; pain] {NormalA}Ugh."
},
{
"k": "19778",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}You first."
},
{
"k": "19779",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}So c'mon man, really... what happened to you?"
},
{
"k": "19780",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I'm not sure I wanna know what happened to everyone else."
},
{
"k": "19781",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "How the fuck did this happen anyway?"
},
{
"k": "19782",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}What about the others?"
},
{
"k": "19783",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Well? Are they okay?"
},
{
"k": "19784",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}What the hell do you have to fight about at a funeral, anyways?"
},
{
"k": "19785",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}I'm trying to find Crane's witch, he's supposed to be heading there."
},
{
"k": "19786",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[sarcastic] {NormalA}I feel {SarcasticA}so much better."
},
{
"k": "19787",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I can help you, you know."
},
{
"k": "19788",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "He'll be back, right? Can't you just leave a message or something?"
},
{
"k": "19789",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Because, let me tell ya, people haven't forgotten about those at all."
},
{
"k": "19790",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "And why it's taking so fucking long to figure it out."
},
{
"k": "19791",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "It's all anyone ever talks about. They want to know what's going on."
},
{
"k": "19792",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "We found some incriminating evidence."
},
{
"k": "19793",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I just have to find him."
},
{
"k": "19794",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ThinkingB}[annoyed] Doesn't matter if you believe it or not. I have evidence that places him at the scene of the crime."
},
{
"k": "19795",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[don't question me] {NormalA}So I'm bringing him in."
},
{
"k": "19796",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}\"Involved\"? How do you mean?"
},
{
"k": "19797",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}That's all I'm going to tell you."
},
{
"k": "19798",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}[scoffs] Typical."
},
{
"k": "19799",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Look, I can help you out. In exchange... you let this little incident slide?"
},
{
"k": "19800",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You've got bigger problems than me."
},
{
"k": "19801",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}[annoyed] Sure."
},
{
"k": "19802",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I should get going."
},
{
"k": "19803",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[slightly annoyed] {SarcasticA}Well. {AngryA}Looks like you've got it covered."
},
{
"k": "19804",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Let you focus on catching Crane."
},
{
"k": "19805",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "This witch business."
},
{
"k": "19806",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Let you take care of... whatever it is you're doing."
},
{
"k": "19807",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I should get out of your hair."
},
{
"k": "19808",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Let you handle this... witch business."
},
{
"k": "19809",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Good luck with... everything."
},
{
"k": "19810",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "See ya around."
},
{
"k": "19811",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}It was really nice catching up with you, I mean that."
},
{
"k": "19812",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "So...  I'll just be going."
},
{
"k": "19813",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Unless you have anything else you want to say to me."
},
{
"k": "19814",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Unless there's something else..."
},
{
"k": "19815",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[forceful] Sit down."
},
{
"k": "19816",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Come on, Jack. You know me better than that."
},
{
"k": "19817",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[forceful] Sit down and don't say a word until I'm ready to deal with you."
},
{
"k": "19818",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Since you're here, how about you make yourself useful."
},
{
"k": "19819",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[impatient; wanting to leave] What am I looking for, exactly?"
},
{
"k": "19820",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "But stay where I can see you."
},
{
"k": "19821",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Anything about Crane's witch. Where she lives, a phone number, directions... you find anything connected to her at all, you tell me."
},
{
"k": "19822",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[annoyed] You won't even tell me what you're doing here."
},
{
"k": "19823",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[annoyed] Look for what?"
},
{
"k": "19824",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Just... let me know if you find anything that has to do with Crane's witch."
},
{
"k": "19825",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I guess I knew that wasn't gonna work."
},
{
"k": "19826",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[annoyed] Alright."
},
{
"k": "19827",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[suspicious] Alright."
},
{
"k": "19828",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[stern] Don't even think about making a run for it."
},
{
"k": "19829",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I wouldn't dream of it."
},
{
"k": "19830",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "There's a message."
},
{
"k": "19831",
"who": "MARY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[slight menace throughout; bored] [resetting sigh] Look, the Crooked Man isn't happy, compadre, and as much as I like making house calls, I have better ways to use my time, so... If you can go ahead and pay him by Friday? That. Would be great. Alright?"
},
{
"k": "19832",
"who": "HANS",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[processed through voice changer; threatening] Did you get our message? [beat] You know who she is. [beat] We told you, call off your investigation or your pet is going to find some interesting evidence. [beat] Call it off. Now."
},
{
"k": "19833",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[to himself] Was this a set up?"
},
{
"k": "19834",
"who": "FEMALE VOICE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[answering machine computer voice] One new message."
},
{
"k": "19835",
"who": "FEMALE VOICE",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[answering machine computer voice] First saved message."
},
{
"k": "19836",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Crane's witch... what's her name?"
},
{
"k": "19837",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[thinking] I think this is from last week. [realizing something] Yeah, Tuesday. Crane went to meet Bluebeard  for lunch at Stone Soup. See."
},
{
"k": "19838",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Uh, I don't know. Not even sure it's a woman, to be honest."
},
{
"k": "19839",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I lost him after he left the restaurant, but he's been pretty regular about picking up glamours. Every Tuesday without fail."
},
{
"k": "19840",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You said you've been following Crane..."
},
{
"k": "19841",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Any of this look familiar?"
},
{
"k": "19842",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Pretty impressive, huh?"
},
{
"k": "19843",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Uh huh."
},
{
"k": "19844",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "This doesn't erase you breaking in here."
},
{
"k": "19845",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Forget you saw this."
},
{
"k": "19846",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I'm good at this."
},
{
"k": "19847",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Maybe be some kind of deputy..."
},
{
"k": "19848",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You know, I could help you out."
},
{
"k": "19849",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "How much does this gig pay anyway?"
},
{
"k": "19850",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Thanks for the help."
},
{
"k": "19851",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Just doing my part."
},
{
"k": "19852",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Hey, no problem."
},
{
"k": "19853",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You're under arrest for breaking and entering."
},
{
"k": "19854",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You never saw this information. Okay?"
},
{
"k": "19855",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I don't want you looking for that witch."
},
{
"k": "19856",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Not so fast."
},
{
"k": "19857",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[Answer the phone]"
},
{
"k": "19858",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[Ignore the call]"
},
{
"k": "19859",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[stern] Stay here."
},
{
"k": "19860",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "I'm not Crane's secretary."
},
{
"k": "19861",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You'd be pretty mad if you missed that call."
},
{
"k": "19862",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Could be the witch."
},
{
"k": "19863",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You got it, chief."
},
{
"k": "19864",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[uneasy] Of course."
},
{
"k": "19865",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}[too quickly] Uh, no."
},
{
"k": "19866",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{Normala}You find any more of these?"
},
{
"k": "19867",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{NormalA}The witch uses the white deer on everything. It's her symbol, or trademark I guess."
},
{
"k": "19868",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{SarcasticA}Do you always talk to yourself like that?"
},
{
"k": "19869",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[to himself] White deer."
},
{
"k": "19870",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Hand them over!"
},
{
"k": "19871",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You seem nervous."
},
{
"k": "19872",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Wanna try that again?"
},
{
"k": "19873",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ThinkingA}[\"I don't have time for this\"] Give 'em to me."
},
{
"k": "19874",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ThinkingA}That it?"
},
{
"k": "19875",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[annoyed] {ThinkingA}You know what. Hand 'em over."
},
{
"k": "19876",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{WorriedA}What do you mean?"
},
{
"k": "19877",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{DoubtfulA}You nervous about somethin'?"
},
{
"k": "19878",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{DoubtfulA}Come on, Jack."
},
{
"k": "19879",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "{ThinkingA}Look me in the eye and tell me you didn't steal anything else."
},
{
"k": "19880",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[intimidating] {AngryA}You wanna try that again?"
},
{
"k": "19881",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[relieved exhale; not too loud]"
},
{
"k": "19882",
"who": "CROOKED MAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[calm] Who is this?"
},
{
"k": "19883",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Hello..."
},
{
"k": "19884",
"who": "CROOKED MAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[calm] Who's that?"
},
{
"k": "19885",
"who": "CROOKED MAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "You're not Ichabod Crane."
},
{
"k": "19886",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[slight sarcasm] Crane residence. How can I help you?"
},
{
"k": "19887",
"who": "CROOKED MAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "Hello... Ichabod?"
},
{
"k": "19888",
"who": "CROOKED MAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
"en": "[calm] If there's somebody there, I'd really like to know who I'm speaking to..."
},
{
"k": "19889",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_craneapt",
